{
  "id": "nba-2k25-delisting",
  "headline": "NBA 2K25 is being delisted after just 2 years",
  "source": "Source: IGN, 2K statement",
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "NBA 2K25 is getting delisted, just two years after launch.",
      "image": "https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2024/0710/r1356919_1111x625_16-9.png"
    },
    {
      "text": "2K will pull it from digital stores on October 30th.",
      "image": "https://media.altchar.com/prod/images/gm_article_promo_image/daa6c0921658-nba-2k25coverr-art.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then on January 1st, 2027, the servers shut down.",
      "image": "https://staticg.sportskeeda.com/editor/2024/09/e9f22-17254565431328-1920.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "That means multiplayer is gone,",
      "image": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/FCI8jJV6mS4/maxresdefault.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "and so is MyCareer, the single player story mode,",
      "image": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/kPSO8K6BJdE/maxresdefault.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "because it needs the servers to run.",
      "image": "https://www.videogamer.com/wp-content/uploads/nba-2k25-server-4b538e50.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "You also can't earn virtual currency anymore.",
      "image": "https://img.gg.deals/a6/09/e26dcbb8bb07a4c70fe47212beebe11fd7e3_1232xr706_Q100.png"
    },
    {
      "text": "If you buy before October 30th, you can still download it and play the offline modes.",
      "image": "https://blog.fr.playstation.com/tachyon/sites/10/2084/08/ec58c3cb910d808fb4656bf3072d7431989e4615.jpg?resize=1088%2C612&crop_strategy=smart"
    },
    {
      "text": "Two years. That's all you get.",
      "image": "https://img.freepik.com/premium-photo/basketball-court-covered-fog-with-basketball-hoop-background-eerie-stillness-empty-basketball-court-only-movement-coming-from-drifting-lone-basketball_538213-102431.jpg?w=1380"
    }
  ]
}